==== Wave 2: Graphics

Visual additions this wave should serve the IFR world: weather presentation, lighting for night IFR, and readability of the instruments and plates you fly by. The foundational toolset's AutoOrtho and X-Camera remain in play.

The visual stack from Waves 0-1 already serves this wave — X-Clouds Enhancer and Bay's Lighting Mod for the sky and the night, BAAC for atmosphere control — and stays in play. Anything further you add belongs here.

